{"chunk_id": "7ca18390-eeb3-4dad-bb28-c39f80a4a943", "doc_id": "08-competitive-comparison", "text": "## 6. 真正的差异化结论\n\n我认为本项目真正与同类产品拉开差距的不是“功能多”，而是以下三点同时成立：\n\n1. 统一的 query / agent / tool / permission 内核\n2. 文件化、可审计、分层的 memory 系统\n3. local-first，但能平滑扩展到 remote / bridge / swarm\n\n很多产品能做到其中一两点，但很少三点同时成立。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "github_md", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "第十六章：同类产品对比 > 6. 真正的差异化结论", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 4}, "char_len": 195}
{"chunk_id": "fce1532c-aaa0-4ed9-9fc1-85f5009f5471", "doc_id": "08-competitive-comparison", "text": "我认为本项目真正与同类产品拉开差距的不是“功能多”，而是以下三点同时成立：", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "github_md", "level": 0, "parent_id": "7ca18390-eeb3-4dad-bb28-c39f80a4a943", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "第十六章：同类产品对比 > 6. 真正的差异化结论", "metadata": {"block_id": "8ab631f0-a290-4cec-b49c-69f5ac4c18b7"}, "char_len": 37}
{"chunk_id": "0d2034dd-d60e-44cc-a578-c0f59d9f2be0", "doc_id": "08-competitive-comparison", "text": "1. 统一的 query / agent / tool / permission 内核\n2. 文件化、可审计、分层的 memory 系统\n3. local-first，但能平滑扩展到 remote / bridge / swarm", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "github_md", "level": 0, "parent_id": "7ca18390-eeb3-4dad-bb28-c39f80a4a943", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "第十六章：同类产品对比 > 6. 真正的差异化结论", "metadata": {"block_id": "ba3d5f5b-ea71-46f1-b7dd-37f946c4852d"}, "char_len": 115}
