{"chunk_id": "b08e8a06-15ff-4992-aa83-29271e285149", "doc_id": "08-competitive-comparison", "text": "## 7. 本章小结\n\n如果从同类产品对比来看，本项目最有辨识度的不是“命令多”或“工具多”，而是它把长期协作、权限治理、多 agent 运行时和 memory 体系放进了同一套本地 agent 平台内核。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "github_md", "level": 1, "parent_id": null, "is_parent": true, "structure_type": "section", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "第十六章：同类产品对比 > 7. 本章小结", "metadata": {"n_blocks": 2}, "char_len": 103}
{"chunk_id": "09817496-8e41-4bb1-bf2b-f80034a0f57b", "doc_id": "08-competitive-comparison", "text": "如果从同类产品对比来看，本项目最有辨识度的不是“命令多”或“工具多”，而是它把长期协作、权限治理、多 agent 运行时和 memory 体系放进了同一套本地 agent 平台内核。", "chunker_name": "structural", "source_type": "github_md", "level": 0, "parent_id": "b08e8a06-15ff-4992-aa83-29271e285149", "is_parent": false, "structure_type": "paragraph", "block_types": [], "index_role": "main", "heading_path": "第十六章：同类产品对比 > 7. 本章小结", "metadata": {"block_id": "d2bdb952-e93f-4804-b780-91a901005349"}, "char_len": 91}
